sec.p:
A systematic literature search was conducted in the OVID MEDLINE and Embase electronic databases. The search queries were developed with a combination of Medical Subject Headings and keywords including hemorrhage, atrial fibrillation, warfarin, and DOAC (
Supplementary Material, Appendix 1
). The search strategy was adapted for each database. Additional relevant studies that met the inclusion criteria were identified through bibliographies of relevant retrieved articles.
